  <StreamGeometry x:Key="IconMarkdown">M5 4.5h9l5 5V20H4V5.5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1z M13.5 4.5V10H19 M7 14v3.5 M7 17.5 5.8 16.2 M7 17.5l1.2-1.3 M10.8 14v3.5 M10.8 14l1.6 2 1.6-2v3.5</StreamGeometry>
